/*!
 * Prayer Dome — Domey's Bible question bank
 * ===========================================================================
 * The questions Domey asks out loud. Over a thousand of them, sorted into
 * topics so the game page can offer "Gospels", "Parables" or the whole Bible.
 *
 *   PDDomeyQuestions.count              // how many questions there are
 *   PDDomeyQuestions.topics()           // every topic, in teaching order
 *   PDDomeyQuestions.pick(10)           // ten random ones
 *   PDDomeyQuestions.pick(10, {topic: 'Parables'})
 *   PDDomeyQuestions.forMascot(10, {topic: 'Gospels'})
 *                                       // shaped exactly as PDMascot.show() wants
 *
 * Every entry carries:
 *   q  the question, printed and spoken
 *   o  four choices (always four, so a spoken answer is never a coin toss)
 *   a  the index of the right choice — spread across the four positions by
 *      scripts/spread-answers.mjs, because a bank whose answer is always the
 *      first option teaches the member nothing
 *   v  the scripture the answer comes from, which Domey reads out afterwards
 *   t  the topic it belongs to
 *
 * Nothing here needs the network, and the whole bank is a single file, so the
 * game works offline exactly like the rest of the app.
 */
